# Interview Questions ⭐

### Q1. Why use replication?

- High Availability
- Read Scaling
- Disaster Recovery
- Geo Distribution
- Better Performance

---

### Q2. Difference between Sync and Async Replication?

```
Sync

Waits for replicas

↓

Strong Consistency

↓

Slower


Async

Returns immediately

↓

Eventual Consistency

↓

Faster
```

---

### Q3. Why is Statement-Based replication risky?

Because queries like

```
NOW()

RAND()

UUID()

CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
```

can generate different values on replicas.

---

### Q4. Why is WAL database-specific?

Because every database engine stores physical disk changes in its own proprietary format.

---

### Q5. Why is Logical Replication preferred?

- Row-level changes
- Easier debugging
- Cross-database support
- Flexible
- Cloud-friendly
- Most modern distributed architectures

