# One-Line Memory Trick 🧠

```
Replication = Multiple DB Copies

Sync      → Wait → Strong Consistency

Async     → Don't Wait → Eventual Consistency

Statement → SQL Queries

WAL       → Physical Bytes

Logical   → Row Changes (Best)
```